<title>USA: PLM board approves rights redemption plan.</title>
<headline>PLM board approves rights redemption plan.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>PLM International Inc said its board of directors has decided to redeem outstanding rights under the company's rights plan first adopted in March 1989.</p>
<p>The rights will be redeemed effective June 24 and shareholders of record as of that date will be paid $0.01 per share on July 24.</p>
</text>
